@step Confirm the command is on your path.
@static aeat --version
@blocked nondeterministic-output Prints the installed release number, which changes with every release of the tool.
@step Ask what is installed and what is missing.
@static aeat config check
@blocked nondeterministic-output Reports this host's memory, accelerator and installed browsers, which differ on every machine.
@step Run the same check with machine-readable output for scripted setups.
@static aeat --format json config check
@blocked nondeterministic-output Reports this host's memory, accelerator and installed browsers, which differ on every machine.
